Cell["\<\
This correctly gives a total number of crossovers of three, summed over \
events involving {13,14,23,24} chromatids.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.98995050880515*^9, 
  3.989950535102662*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a5c67cd8-7008-45a6-a334-\
